OL,3,GNEWSAForest scheme fraudsters earned
OL,4,A#14m, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men made #14m after persuading
OL,7,Fclients to invest their pensions in a
OL,8,Ftree-planting scam, a court has heard.
OL,10,FMatthew Pickard, 55, Stephen Greenaway,
OL,11,F46, and Paul Laver, 47, spent their
OL,12,Fmoney on luxury cars, holidays, watches
OL,13,Fand jewellery, Southwark Crown Court
OL,14,Fwas told.
OL,16,FOpening a two-day sentencing hearing
OL,17,Ffor fraud, prosecutors said Pickard,
OL,18,Ffrom Lytchett Matravers, Dorset, was
OL,19,Fthe "driving force" behind
OL,20,FBournemouth-based Ethical Forestry Ltd.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
